  "thread-free_lock-cfg-duplicate": {
   "sites": 2,
   "result": "BLOCKED 2/2 (unchanged)",
   "missing_fact": "no receipt-side selector exists for an item with two cfg-gated definitions. resolve_operation_span finds both definitions (679 and 700), neither is inside a named container, so the qualified-identity rule cannot choose one, and it refuses ambiguous-identity before the recorded span hash is ever compared. The locators argument is accepted but unused, and load_boundaries/adjudicate carry no declared-span field. span_coverage_controls documents this refusal as intended",
